      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY WEE LASS (6) was out of the placings last time when sixth at Taree Super Track (17.94) but scored four back at this track (23.12). Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Has ability and is a key runner. MY IRISH (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (26.03) in a Grade 5 at Gunnedah. Form from his last run is proving strong. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. MINTER MULWEE (1) was below best last time finishing seventh at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 4/5 win two back at this track. Can feature with the right run. NUKKUNYA (2) is worth including.",
